From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Marc=20T=C3=B6nsing?= <mtoensing@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:00:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] perf: RowWorkers claims bands from a shared counter;
 table-driven parallel colour math

Uneven rows (models mid-frame, ground vs sky) no longer wait on the slowest
static slice, and late-waking workers are not waited for. Output is
byte-identical (frame/audio digests unchanged).

